<td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
<td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Powders of roots and rhizomes
    of <i>Panax notoginseng </i>containing ginsenoside and sanchinoside, dencichine, flavonoids, amino acids.</span></td>
