<td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Dry roots of <i>Hedysarum
    polybotrys </i>containing flavonoids, saponins, polysaccharides.</span></td>
<td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
<td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Sweating; dizziness, palpitations;
    shortness of breath; chronic diarrhea archoptosis; dyspeptic fullness; indigestion; hemiplegia, arthralgia, numbness; chronic wound;
    diabetic nephropathy; low immunity; cancer; and liver disease.</span></td>
<td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
<td style="text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">2015</span></td></tr>
