    (powders)</span></td>
<td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
<td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Powders heartwoods of <i>Caesalpinia
    sappan </i>containing homeisoflavonoid, and triterpenoid compounds.</span></td>
<td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
<td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Digestive tract tumor;
    liver cancer; ovarian neoplasms; cervical cancer; chronic myeloid leukemia; fracture; traumatic injury; thoracic abdominal pain;
    carbuncle furuncle sore; immunosuppressive agent; and diabetes.</span></td>
<td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
<td style="text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">2015</span></td></tr>
