<td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
<td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Dry blood of <i>Cervus
    nippon or Cervus elaphus </i>containing proteins.</span></td>
<td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
<td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Leukopenia; thrombocytopenia;
    or hypoimmunity; chronic anemia; aplastic anemia; erectile dysfunction; and postoperative rehabilitation.</span></td>
