<td style="border-bottom: black 4.5pt double; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-weight: bold;">(602,855</span></span></td>
<td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-weight: bold;">)</span></span></td>
<td>&#160;</td>
