from manufacture and sales of the following products: three types of TCMP products, consisting of Advanced TCMP, and Regular
TCMP, and others. As compared with the year ended March 31, 2024, our total revenues decreased by $187,590,
or 10%, for the year ended March 31, 2025.</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The following table sets
forth the breakdown of revenues by revenue source for each period presented:</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
